createdby: DBot
description: 'Retrieves the IAM policy for a Google Cloud Storage bucket. Returns
  the policy version, ETag, and list of role bindings including members and their
  assigned roles. Use this action to check for public access by looking for allUsers
  or allAuthenticatedUsers members in the bindings, or to audit which principals have
  access to a specific bucket. REQUIRES: `project_id`, `bucket_name`. When these are
  not present in user input, resolve them first via `CortexListAssets` using the issue''s
  asset_id or asset_name.'
